  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking Changes/Major Improvements: Moved the editor styles into CSS variables. Added many new features: 1) A better video dialog; 2) horizontal reference; 3) word and character count; 4) improved accessibility features; 5) better default Fluent UI styles; 6) improved documentation; 7) small bug fixes. This second revision is a native web component called rt-native that will be provided on NPM. The Blazor component is a wrapper for rt-native.js and allows the developer to configure options using C#.",
